&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is a US-headquartered, global leader in agent-first brokerage infrastructure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for stocks, ETFs, options, crypto, fixed income, 24/5 trading, and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Amongst our subsidiaries, Alpaca is a licensed financial services company, serving hundreds of financial institutions across 40 countries with our institutional-grade APIs. This includes broker-dealers, investment advisors, wealth managers, hedge funds, and crypto exchanges, totalling over 10 million brokerage accounts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our global team is a diverse group of experienced engineers, traders, and brokerage professionals who are working to achieve our mission of opening financial services to everyone on the planet. We&#39;re deeply committed to open-source contributions and fostering a vibrant community, continuously enhancing our award-winning, developer-friendly API and the robust infrastructure behind it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is proudly backed by $400 million in funding from top-tier global investors including Portage Ventures, Spark Capital, Tribe Capital, Social Leverage, Horizons Ventures, Opera Tech Ventures, SBI Group, Derayah Financial, Unbound, Peak XV, Elefund, and Y Combinator.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Team Members:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a dynamic team of 400+ globally distributed members who thrive working from our favorite places around the world, with teammates spanning the USA, Canada, Japan, Hungary, Nigeria, Brazil, the UK, and beyond!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re searching for passionate individuals eager to contribute to Alpaca&#39;s rapid growth. If you align with our core values—Stay Curious, Have Empathy, and Be Accountable—and are ready to make a significant impact, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Graphic Designer who combines exceptional craft with deep production expertise. Working within the brand vision and creative direction, you’ll translate campaign concepts into polished, consistent assets across a wide range of go-to-market channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly hands-on role. You’ll spend most of your time designing and producing work for integrated marketing campaigns, product launches, demand-generation programs, sales enablement, events, partnerships, and corporate communications. You’ll bring senior judgment to the execution—anticipating production needs, solving problems independently, and ensuring every deliverable is accurate, on-brand, and appropriate for its audience and channel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in fintech or financial services is a strong advantage. We operate in a trust-sensitive, highly technical space where clarity, consistency, and attention to detail matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate established creative concepts and brand direction into polished assets across multiple go-to-market channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce campaign deliverables for web, paid and organic social, email, landing pages, events, webinars, print, and other digital formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create sales and partner collateral, including presentations, pitch decks, one-pagers, case studies, solution briefs, and reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support product launches, demand-generation campaigns, account-based marketing programs, and regional go-to-market initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapt core campaign ideas into channel-specific executions while preserving a consistent visual story&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with marketing, sales, content, communications, and regional teams to understand requirements and manage deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn complex financial and technical information into clear, credible, and visually engaging materials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain reusable templates and modular asset systems that improve production speed and consistency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply Alpaca’s established standards for typography, color, illustration, iconography, imagery, and layout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare production-ready files and perform detailed quality assurance across formats, specifications, links, copy, and brand requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple concurrent requests, communicate tradeoffs, and deliver high-quality work under tight deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide thoughtful craft feedback and help improve production practices across the creative team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of professional experience in graphic, visual, brand, or marketing design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio demonstrating exceptional execution across integrated campaigns, digital marketing, presentations, and sales collateral&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience producing multi-channel go-to-market assets within an established brand and creative direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agency or high-volume in-house experience, with the ability to manage multiple briefs and deliverables simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert proficiency in Figma and Adobe Creative Suite, including Illustrator, Photoshop, and InDesign&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced presentation-design skills, particularly for executive, sales, and customer-facing materials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of production requirements across digital, social, web, presentation, and print formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent typography, composition, layout, and information-hierarchy skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to extend a creative concept across formats without diluting or unnecessarily reinventing it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and a disciplined approach to file organization, version control, specifications, and final quality assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with creative directors, designers, marketers, copywriters, and cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The maturity to receive direction and feedback, ask productive questions, and execute independently once alignment is established&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fintech, financial services, developer tools, infrastructure, data, enterprise software, or another technical industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motion design experience using After Effects, Lottie, or similar tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting global or regionalized campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with localization and creating adaptable campaign toolkits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a high-growth startup or distributed in-house creative team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Take Care of You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; Stock Options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Health Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;New Hire Home-Office Setup: One-time USD $500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Monthly Stipend: USD $150 per month via a Brex Card&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Alpaca is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace dedicated to pursuing and hiring a diverse workforce.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
